                     <br/>anhydrous citric acid, butylparaben,<br/>D&amp;C Red # 33, FD&amp;C Blue # 1, flavor,<br/>glycerin, high fructose corn syrup,<br/>microcrystalline cellulose and<br/>carboxymethylcellulose sodium,<br/>propylene glycol, purified water, sodium<br/>benzoate, sorbitol solution, sucralose,<br/>xanthan gum.</paragraph>
               </text>
